------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CLINICAL DISCLAIMER
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
FOR INTERNAL USE ONLY. This is educational clinical decision support for
trained residents and physicians. It is NOT a clinical protocol and is not a
substitute for clinical judgment or institutional policy.

NO PATIENT DATA. The dashboard stores and transmits nothing; do not enter PHI.

The Maximum Surgical Blood Order Schedule is institution-specific (Henry Ford
Health, policy PCR-PALM-TRM-5.050). ASFA categories follow the 9th Special
Issue (2023). Antigen and ABO frequencies are population estimates. Verify all
content against current institutional policy and the primary sources before
acting on a patient. The treating physician / blood-bank medical director
remains the final decision-maker.

The software is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or
implied. The authors accept no liability for any claim or damages arising from
its use.

